---
/**
 * CommitGaps.astro
 *
 * 副校长回复链路重构那篇博文第五节的图：一轮回答的提交顺序，以及崩溃可能落在的六个间隙。
 * 第一版崩溃矩阵只在「记进度之后」注入故障，漏掉了「已写入、未记进度」这两个最危险的间隙；
 * 图里把它们用强调色标出来。
 *
 * 静态 SVG，没有 JS，没有动效。样式只用站点语义 token，明暗主题自动跟随。
 */
---

<figure class='cg-fig not-prose'>
  <figcaption class='cg-cap'>
    <strong>图 2 · 一轮回答的提交顺序，和崩溃可能落在的六个间隙。</strong>权威记录先在 SQLite 里与投递状态同一事务写入，之后每个投影按 turnId 幂等补齐。第一版崩溃矩阵没有测到的两个间隙用强调色标出。
  </figcaption>

  <div class='cg-scroll'>
  <svg
    class='cg-svg'
    viewBox='0 0 656 150'
    role='img'
    aria-label='示意图：从左到右五个步骤——SQLite 事务写入投递状态与权威提交记录、追加会话日志行、记录进度一、写入问答记忆、记录进度二。步骤之间和两端共六个崩溃注入点，其中「追加会话日志之后、记录进度之前」和「写入问答记忆之后、记录进度之前」两个间隙被强调，因为第一版测试矩阵没有覆盖它们。'
  >
    <!-- 五个步骤 -->
    <g class='cg-step cg-step-tx'>
      <rect x='36' y='70' width='120' height='64' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='96' y='96' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-md cg-bold'>SQLite 事务</text>
      <text x='96' y='114' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>投递状态 + 权威记录</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cg-step'>
      <rect x='192' y='70' width='92' height='64' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='238' y='96' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-md cg-bold'>追加</text>
      <text x='238' y='114' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>会话日志行</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cg-step cg-step-mark'>
      <rect x='320' y='70' width='72' height='64' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='356' y='96' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-md cg-bold'>记进度</text>
      <text x='356' y='114' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>①</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cg-step'>
      <rect x='428' y='70' width='92' height='64' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='474' y='96' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-md cg-bold'>写入</text>
      <text x='474' y='114' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>问答记忆</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cg-step cg-step-mark'>
      <rect x='556' y='70' width='72' height='64' rx='8'></rect>
      <text x='592' y='96' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-md cg-bold'>记进度</text>
      <text x='592' y='114' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>②</text>
    </g>

    <!-- 箭头 -->
    <g class='cg-arrow'>
      <path d='M156,102 L186,102'></path>
      <path d='M284,102 L314,102'></path>
      <path d='M392,102 L422,102'></path>
      <path d='M520,102 L550,102'></path>
      <path d='M181,98 L187,102 L181,106'></path>
      <path d='M309,98 L315,102 L309,106'></path>
      <path d='M417,98 L423,102 L417,106'></path>
      <path d='M545,98 L551,102 L545,106'></path>
    </g>

    <!-- 六个崩溃注入点（上方短竖线 + 编号） -->
    <g class='cg-crash'>
      <path d='M28,48 L28,62'></path>
      <text x='28' y='40' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>提交前</text>
      <path d='M172,48 L172,62'></path>
      <text x='172' y='40' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>事务后</text>
      <path d='M406,48 L406,62'></path>
      <text x='406' y='40' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>记进度后</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cg-crash cg-crash-hot'>
      <path d='M300,48 L300,62'></path>
      <text x='300' y='40' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-bold'>已追加、未记进度</text>
      <path d='M536,48 L536,62'></path>
      <text x='536' y='40' text-anchor='middle' class='cg-fs-sm cg-bold'>已写入、未记进度</text>
    </g>
    <g class='cg-crash'>
      <path d='M634,48 L634,62'></path>
      <text x='652' y='40' text-anchor='end' class='cg-fs-sm cg-muted'>记进度后</text>
    </g>

  </svg>
  </div>

  <p class='cg-note'>
    崩溃后重启：读 SQLite 里的权威记录，按 turnId 检查每个投影是否已存在，缺什么补什么。恢复只写记录，从不重新发送；没有真实 ACK 的轮次不伪造消息 ID。<span class='cg-note-hot'>强调色</span>标出的两个间隙，是第一版崩溃矩阵 12/12 全绿时没有注入故障的位置：关掉「防重复追加」的变异当时没有被抓到，补上这两个注入点之后才被抓到。
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .cg-fig {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .cg-cap {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .cg-cap strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .cg-note {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .cg-note-hot {
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cg-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 680px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .cg-svg text {
    font-family: inherit;
    fill: hsl(var(--foreground));
  }

  .cg-svg .cg-muted {
    fill: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
  }

  .cg-svg .cg-bold {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .cg-fs-sm {
    font-size: 11.5px;
  }

  .cg-fs-md {
    font-size: 13.5px;
  }

  .cg-step rect {
    fill: hsl(var(--card));
    stroke: hsl(var(--border));
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .cg-step-tx rect {
    stroke: hsl(var(--foreground));
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .cg-step-mark rect {
    fill: hsl(var(--muted));
  }

  .cg-arrow path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .cg-crash path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .cg-crash-hot path {
    stroke: hsl(var(--primary));
    stroke-width: 3;
  }

  .cg-crash-hot text {
    fill: hsl(var(--primary));
  }

  .cg-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cg-svg {
      min-width: 600px;
    }
  }
</style>
